@RULE Bound-Order
Outputs bound by neighbors under rotate4reflect: where two variants of one transition
match a block with different bindings, the earlier one counts.
@TABLE
n_states:4
neighborhood:vonNeumann
symmetries:rotate4reflect
var a={1,2,3}
var b={1,2,3}
var c={0,1,2,3}
var d={c}
0,a,b,0,0,a
0,a,a,b,c,b
1,a,b,c,d,b
2,a,0,0,0,3
3,c,c,d,d,0
